Subject: [PATCH 41/60] Muse Spark behind the native server: lane backend, plan
 link, tf-muse follow

engine.zig: the plan link's hello / forward / stop (MiMo-V2's shape) and a graphed forward with device argmax;
native.zig: model_type muse_spark registered in native/cuda.zig, the lane backend (prompts as decode windows of
up to 128 rows, shared verify windows, keyed sampling), costs timed at load, rank weights at TP=2, no drafter
and no prompt path yet; tf-muse follow runs rank 1. Windows wider than 32 rows run eagerly (same bits).
Built; not served yet.
